Counterfactual shutil.copytree accidentally included crates/hypersolve/target/coverage and exhausted the /tmp user quota. The new owned copy was 4.4 GiB; only that copied directory was removed. Original repository caches untouched. The simultaneous candidate compile failed with actual Disk quota exceeded. Retried with git-archive tracked sources and explicit candidate overrides. No geometric exhaustion or test outcome is inferred from this host-storage failure.
